    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "doctors and therapy just feel like more noise. more talking, more explaining, more useless stuff. it just feels like everyone is trying to keep me in this loud, bright world when all i want is to just... not be here. to just be still. it feels like the only way to really get that absolute quiet is to just stop everything. do you think people are just meant to live in this constant chaos forever?",
